WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.150
Meet .light.

00:00:01.353 --> 00:00:03.383
A glowing island for your Windows screen.

00:00:04.485 --> 00:00:06.655
Hover it, and your music is right there.

00:00:06.833 --> 00:00:08.883
Scroll over it to change the volume.

00:00:09.885 --> 00:00:11.215
Coding with Claude?

00:00:11.238 --> 00:00:14.888
See every session at a glance,
and know the moment it needs your OK.

00:00:15.852 --> 00:00:18.382
Your phone's notifications land here too.

00:00:18.630 --> 00:00:21.920
Copy a login code in one click,
and never miss a call.

00:00:22.818 --> 00:00:25.388
Take a screenshot and
drag it into any app.

00:00:25.606 --> 00:00:28.256
Everything you copy is
saved and searchable.

00:00:29.152 --> 00:00:29.902
Prompt snippets,

00:00:30.292 --> 00:00:34.222
a focus timer, a file shelf and
a file lab, all one hover away.

00:00:35.185 --> 00:00:38.475
It shows when your camera or mic is on,
when you're charging,

00:00:38.665 --> 00:00:40.135
and when a download is done.

00:00:41.052 --> 00:00:41.842
.light.

00:00:42.145 --> 00:00:43.095
Free for Windows.

